abstract: >
  Data analytics project focused on relational data and SQL
  implemented within Python source files.
  The project emphasizes querying structured datasets,
  applying joins and aggregations,
  and integrating analytics-oriented database engines
  such as DuckDB and SQLite
  within a professional, reproducible project workflow.

